1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,471
Three characters.

2
00:00:01,471 --> 00:00:07,812
Evans: hot tempered and greedy, swearing at the corpse and digging on after two pricks.

3
00:00:07,812 --> 00:00:14,466
Hooker: careful and watchful, the story's eyes, the one who understands, too late.

4
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:23,684
And Chang-hi, who never appears on stage, yet wins: the shrewd man the robbers looked down on out-thinks them from beyond death.

